# Xenith — dark theme after Xenith's original look (Catppuccin Mocha)
#
# A whole-system theme like the others; tools/xen also pins a
# stand-alone Xenith to it. Xenith takes its body from the edit*
# keys, its tags from header and text, its selection from menuhilit,
# its frame borders from accent and border, and its button 2/3/modified
# colours from red, green and yellow.

